# Nothing secret is committed unencrypted (see README.md, "Secrets").
#
# Everything local and secret lives in secrets/: the SOPS/age key, the cluster
# CAs and join token, and the admin kubeconfig. ign/ is build output with the
# same secrets baked in.
/secrets/
/ign/

# The same files wherever else they turn up, e.g. where they lived before
# secrets/ existed (k8s/, k8s/butane/)
*.agekey
kubeconfig
certs/
ign/
00_base-k8s-token.yaml
00_base-k8s-pki.yaml
